{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T16:56:43+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-28T16:56:43+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Coloplast A/S","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","country":"Denmark","city":"Humlebæk","website":"https://www.coloplast.com","employees":17213,"summary":"Coloplast A/S engages in the development and sale of intimate healthcare products and services in Denmark, the United States, the United Kingdom, France, and internationally. The company operates through Chronic Care, Continence Care, Voice and Respiratory Care, Interventional Urology, and Advanced Wound Dressings and Biologics segments. It provides ostomy care products, including SenSura Mio, which provides fit individual body shapes and discretion for various types of ostomies; and SenSura Ostomy care solutions, as well as ostomy accessories under the Brava brand. The company also offers continence care products, such as Conveen Active urine bags; SpeediCath catheters that offer catheterization for both genders; Peristeen Plus, a transanal irrigation system; and Peristeen Light, a low-volume transanal irrigation. In addition, it provides wound care products comprising conforming dressing under the Biatain Silicone brand and hydrocolloid dressing under the Comfeel brand. Further, the company develops, produces, and markets products for the surgical treatment of urological and gynecological disorders, such as erectile dysfunction, urinary stone diseases, benign prostate hyperplasia, voiding dysfunctions, and urinary incontinence. Additionally, its voice and respiratory care solutions include laryngectomy care products comprising Provox, a voice prosthesis for speaking, HMEs, adhesives, laryngectomy tubes for breathing, devices for speaking hands-free, and accessories, as well as tracheostomy care products under Tracoe brand. Coloplast A/S was founded in 1954 and is headquartered in Humlebæk, Denmark.","exchange":"Copenhagen","currency":"DKK","financial_currency":"DKK","summary_fr":"Coloplast A/S s’engage dans le développement et la vente de produits et services de soins de santé intimes au Danemark, aux États-Unis, au Royaume-Uni, en France et à l’international. La société opère à travers les secteurs des soins chroniques, des soins de continence, des soins vocaux et respiratoires, de l'urologie interventionnelle, des pansements de plaies avancés et des produits biologiques. Il fournit des produits de soins de stomie, y compris SenSura Mio, qui fournit des formes de corps individuelles adaptées et une discrétion pour divers types de stomies; et des solutions de soins de stomie SenSura, ainsi que des accessoires de stomie sous la marque Brava.","summary_fr_excerpt":true},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":107838660608,"shares_outstanding":207368138,"trailing_pe":39.02936,"forward_pe":18.419197,"price_to_book":8.060305,"ev_to_ebitda":15.131,"ev_to_revenue":4.588,"dividend_yield":0.0482,"payout_ratio":1.876,"beta_yahoo":0.565},"targets":{"current_price":478.5,"mean":461.61905,"median":455.0,"high":575.0,"low":377.0,"n_analysts":21,"reco_mean":2.95238,"reco_key":"hold"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-03"],"eps_avg":5.7266,"eps_low":2.21109,"eps_high":7.17,"revenue_avg":7405010510,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-18","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.29795,"institutions_pct":0.29986,"institutions_float_pct":0.42711,"institutions_n":400,"institutions":[{"name":"Pacer Advisors, Inc.","pct":0.0,"shares":921,"value":440698,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":-0.0466}],"funds":[{"name":"MFS SERIES TRUST X-MFS International Intrinsic Equity Fund","pct":0.0167,"shares":3500939,"value":1675199311,"date":"2026-08-31","chg":0.16420001},{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0094,"shares":1974722,"value":944904477,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0095999995},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Va